# Benchmark datasets (RR1 fix): corpus, queries, qrels, per-model ranking files, raw-result JSON,
# source PDFs, and generated reports are published artifacts and must stay tracked. Vector indexes
# and other regenerable run-internal files (batch logs, timing scratch data) are excluded.
datasets/*/chromadb_collections/
datasets/*/analysis/*
!datasets/*/analysis/rankings_M*.jsonl
datasets/*/reports/batches/
datasets/*/reports/timing_data_*.json
batch_history.jsonl

# Internal working files: kept on disk, not published. The public repo carries the
# pipeline, datasets/, paper sources and figures only. ML_Submission holds the
